      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "Da la bienvenida a tu futuro"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "\"Technology is very apt at answering the question what can be done, but we need design to answer the question what should be done.\""
    },
    {
      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "“This is innovation at work: borrowing, revising, rethinking, testing, and challenging norms, all for a greater purpose.”"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h5",
      "text": "“I view innovation as turning a new idea into a solution that adds value for a customer, or their customers, where previously there wasn’t.”"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "¡Empieza a vivir tu sueño!"
    },
